{#-
  The newsletter layout as a Resend broadcast template, for
  `just email-export <theme>`. Pasted into Resend's HTML editor, it is the
  frame; the campaign's words replace the marked paragraph below.

  Resend fills the triple-brace placeholders when it sends:
    {{{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}}  the recipient's own unsubscribe link,
                                  which also serves the one-click
                                  List-Unsubscribe header Gmail and Yahoo
                                  require of bulk senders
  Jinja leaves them alone: they are plain text inside a string value.
-#}
{% extends "newsletter.html.j2" %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}
{% block subject %}Newsletter{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<!-- CAMPAIGN CONTENT: replace from here to the end marker. Use a heading,
     paragraphs, panels and buttons as in the Storybook newsletter story. -->
{{ c.heading("Newsletter *title*") }}
{{ c.paragraph("Write the campaign here.") }}
<!-- END CAMPAIGN CONTENT -->
{% endblock %}
{% block text %}{% endblock %}
